    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34948" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναπο-σημαίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>indicate</i> or <i>point out in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱστορίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cim.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>impress</i> or <i>stamp on</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεισμοὶ τὴν ἁρμονίαν τῶν ὀρῶν
					ἐναπεσημήναντο τοῖς τμήμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					2.17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.291
			</span></i>.</div>
